      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it is a reality. i see it in every notification, every look in the street. it feels like the person i used to be was killed off months ago. there's nothing left but this hollow shell that everyone loves to hate. if the version of me that people respected is dead, then what am i even doing still trying to pretend i'm here? it feels like i'm just waiting for the rest of the world to catch up.",
